Receive flight updates and check gate, terminal, departure & arrival information.
- Get detailed Airports Info;
Including terminal maps, local time, and actual weather. 
- Keep the Flight Board in your pocket;  
Easy access to arrivals & departure info. 
- Watch airplanes move around the world with real-time Plane Radar; 
